*.npy
*.parquet
*.feather
# (The rdkit_ds1/rdkit_ds2 npz un-ignore rules were removed: those trees are now packed
#  into artifacts/data_features.7z rather than committed.)

# Packed archives under artifacts/ (LFS in .gitattributes)
# The un-ignore rules must be the LAST word on these paths. A bare
# `artifacts/*.7z` used to sit below them and silently re-ignored every archive,
# so nothing was ever handed to LFS; do not reintroduce it.
!artifacts/
!artifacts/**/*.7z
!artifacts/**/*.md

# Incomplete 7-Zip / LFS sidecars stay ignored. These patterns do not match a
# finished `.7z`, so they cannot undo the rules above.
*.7z.tmp
*.7z.tmp.*
artifacts/*.tmp

# --- Working folders that are not part of the record ------------------------
# Scratch copies delivered during drafting sessions.
Claude outputs/
# Anything staged for deletion by a cleanup pass, and the dated quarantine.
**/_to_delete/
_quarantine_*/
